Package: phylo.fda
Title: Phylogenetic Flexible Discriminant Analysis
Version: 0.3.11
Authors@R: 
    person("Lars", "Schmitz", email = "lschmitz@cmc.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements phylogenetically adjusted flexible discriminant analysis
    for classification and prediction of taxa while accounting for expected
    phylogenetic covariance. The package includes tools for fitting
    phylogenetic FDA models, optimizing Pagel's lambda, predicting classes and
    posterior probabilities, preparing training and test datasets, and
    visualizing discriminant scores and lambda sensitivity.
